![](/image/development/b0012e21f1855fc786c3.png)

## Customizing appearance

Modifiers such as `accentColor` and `listRowBackground` adjust the appearance of the list and its rows.

```swift
NavigationView {
    List {
        Section {
            ForEach(fruits, id: \.self) { fruit in
                Text(fruit)
                	// Style the row
                    .font(.headline)
                    .foregroundColor(.white)
                    .padding()
            }
            .onDelete(perform: delete)
            .onMove(perform: move)
            // Set the row background
            .listRowBackground(Color.blue)
        } header: {
        	// Add a header image
            HStack {
                Image(systemName: "flame.fill")
                Text("Fruits")
            }
        }
    }
    // Change the list's accent color
    .accentColor(.green)
    .navigationTitle("Grocery List")
    .navigationBarItems(
        leading: EditButton(),
        trailing: addButton
    )
}
// Change the navigation accent color
.accentColor(.red)
```

